# Local Environment

## OS and Shell
- Windows 11, default shell: **PowerShell**
- Use PowerShell syntax: `New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force` not `mkdir -p`, semicolons or `&&` to chain commands

## Python and uv
- Python 3.14 (pinned in `.python-version`), managed by **uv** — never pip or pyenv
- `uv add` for deps, `uv run` to execute, `uv sync --all-packages` to install workspace
- uv location: `C:\Users\krzys\.local\bin\uv.exe` (use `uv` in commands, full path only as fallback)

## GitHub CLI
- `gh` v2.88.1, authenticated as `ksopyla` (SSH protocol)
- Prefer `gh` over GitHub MCP for PRs, issues, actions

## Repository
- Repo: `git@github.com:ksopyla/agent-patterns-lab.git`
- Branches: `main` (stable), `dev` (working)
- Secrets via `.env` (copy `.env.example`)
